  "content": "<p>来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多神器</a>的召回药水，现作为独立模组推出</p><p>本模组在游戏中添加了一瓶简单的召回药水，能将你传送回你的重生点！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9df22e52-3527-4fbf-b1c4-c96cdbd76b44.png\" width=\"626\" height=\"389\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_339cabf1-62fc-4954-9847-d1237a8f31ff.gif\" width=\"628\" height=\"353\"></p><p>召回药水仅在玩家当前所在的维度生效，除非将跨维度配置项设为true</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
